# SIMULATION (model curve), NOT an observation. Asthana et al. (2024), MNRAS 533, 2843 (arXiv:2404.06548), Fig. 5 panel (e) (green dashed): mean free path at 912 A in proper Mpc (no h), z = 5-6.5.
#   "Democratic" source model: haloes >= 1e9 Msun/h, the same Ndot for every halo; 4 bins, H + He.
